<verse_n verse_n="1">
<translation translation="so also did He regard him that was careless as a bad servant, for He spake saying, ' That wicked servant shall say in his heart, 'My master tarrieth.' And he shall begin to smite his fellow servants, and to eat, and to drink, and to become drunken.">
