<chapter_n chapter_n="80">
<verse_n verse_n="1">
<translation translation="Ahab sorrowed in his heart because of the sin which he had committed, and he escaped from the wrath of God by means of this medicine. And Nebuchadnezzar (βαλτασαρ) (escaped) through mercy.">
