<chapter_n chapter_n="94">
<verse_n verse_n="1">
<translation translation="If thou hast abandoned (the eating of) bread overmuch, and of other kinds of food, but hast not abandoned passion, nor hast gotten for thyself spiritual excellences, in what way then hast thou benefited by the fasting?">
