<verse_n verse_n="2">
<translation translation="If also He were to examine carefully in respect of looking (upon our neighbours) with evil intent (or, maliciously), what should we do? And if He were to search into us carefully in respect of our evil desires, and if He were to demand from us our words of abuse, would any of us be able to open our mouths?">
