<chapter_n chapter_n="105">
<verse_n verse_n="1">
<translation translation="And even if we had not been threatened definitely with Gehenna, it would have been meet for us to keep our sins in our memory at all times, (and seeing that) this Gehenna is ready for us, how much more are we bound to keep our sins in remembrance?">
